# 統一用 LF 換行，避免 Windows 端的 autocrlf 把文字檔轉成 CRLF 造成整檔差異與雜湊不一致
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.astro text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
# 二進位檔不做任何轉換
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
